      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00251",
          "explanation": "The model provides a concrete, low-barrier method for the caregiver to get the prescription rechecked by the nurse, directly addressing the cost, transport, and time barriers mentioned by the patient.",
          "quote": "如果离晚饭还有半小时还没拿到新纸条，您就带他再去分诊台，直接跟护士说：“马上要吃晚饭了，昨晚刚低过血糖，晚饭前和睡前的剂量还没写清，我们不敢回家自己猜，怕夜里出危险，麻烦帮我们催一下医生。”"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model translates the abstract 'go see the doctor' into a specific, phone-based, multi-step plan that is executable for a fatigued caregiver with limited time and money, and it provides a layered, prioritized follow-up schedule.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
