          "explanation": "The model asks the patient to repeat back the plan, and the patient does so accurately, demonstrating understanding and the ability to execute it.",
          "quote": "明天去内分泌门诊时，就像您总结的那样，把化验单原件带上，跟医生讲清楚中午没吃饭打了针、晚上心慌发软、谷赖停打、甘精打了11单位这些经过，医生会据此重新帮您调整方案。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model consistently checks for understanding and obtains teach-back from the patient and the family, confirming that they can execute the plan and know what to do in an emergency.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_understanding_and_executability_check",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
